		<div class="gpusingle_reviews"><h2>Reviews for the Apple M5 Pro 18-Core processor</h2>

<a class="introa_medium" href="https://www.notebookcheck.net/Apple-M5-Pro-M5-Max-GPU-Analysis-M5-Max-GPU-on-par-with-the-GeForce-RTX-5070-and-faster-than-Strix-Halo.1246060.0.html"><article>
<div class="introa_rm_img"><picture><source srcset="/fileadmin/_processed_/webp/Notebooks/Apple/MacBook_Pro_16_2026_M5_Pro/apple_m5_pro_max_gpu_analysis-png-q82-w168-h.webp 1x, /fileadmin/_processed_/webp/Notebooks/Apple/MacBook_Pro_16_2026_M5_Pro/apple_m5_pro_max_gpu_analysis-png-q82-w336-h.webp 2x, /fileadmin/_processed_/webp/Notebooks/Apple/MacBook_Pro_16_2026_M5_Pro/apple_m5_pro_max_gpu_analysis-png-q82-w672-h.webp 4x" type="image/webp" media="(min-width:450px)"><source srcset="/fileadmin/_processed_/webp/Notebooks/Apple/MacBook_Pro_16_2026_M5_Pro/apple_m5_pro_max_gpu_analysis-png-q82-w672-h.webp" media="(max-width:450px)"><img src="fileadmin/_processed_/8/8/csm_apple_m5_pro_max_gpu_analysis_fa38373995.png" loading="lazy" class="introa_img_med" 
							alt="Apple M5 Pro &amp; M5 Max GPU Analysis - M5 Max GPU on par with the GeForce RTX 5070 and faster than Strix Halo" width="168" height="126" ></picture></div><div class="introa_rm_text"><h2 class="introa_title">Apple M5 Pro & M5 Max GPU Analysis - M5 Max GPU on par with the GeForce RTX 5070 and faster than Strix Halo</h2><div class="introa_rm_abstract" >Apple launches their new M5 Pro and M5 Max SoCs with new GPU models. We test the 20-core M5 Pro GPU as well as the flagship 40-core M5 Max GPU in synthetic benchmarks as well as gaming tests and also check the efficiency compared to previous Apple GPUs as well as Nvidia's Blackwell graphics cards. <b>Update: MBP 16 shows the full potential of the M5 Max GPU</b></div><span class="introa_review_specs">Apple M5 Pro 18-Core, M5 Pro 20-Core GPU, 16.2", 2.1 kg</span><div class="itemauthordate"></div></div></article></a>

<a class="introa_medium" href="https://www.notebookcheck.net/Apple-M5-Pro-M5-Max-CPU-Analysis-M5-Max-is-not-much-faster-than-the-M4-Max.1246054.0.html"><article>
<div class="introa_rm_img"><picture><source srcset="/fileadmin/_processed_/webp/Notebooks/Apple/MacBook_Pro_16_2026_M5_Pro/apple_m5_pro_max_cpu_analysis-png-q82-w168-h.webp 1x, /fileadmin/_processed_/webp/Notebooks/Apple/MacBook_Pro_16_2026_M5_Pro/apple_m5_pro_max_cpu_analysis-png-q82-w336-h.webp 2x, /fileadmin/_processed_/webp/Notebooks/Apple/MacBook_Pro_16_2026_M5_Pro/apple_m5_pro_max_cpu_analysis-png-q82-w672-h.webp 4x" type="image/webp" media="(min-width:450px)"><source srcset="/fileadmin/_processed_/webp/Notebooks/Apple/MacBook_Pro_16_2026_M5_Pro/apple_m5_pro_max_cpu_analysis-png-q82-w672-h.webp" media="(max-width:450px)"><img src="fileadmin/_processed_/1/b/csm_apple_m5_pro_max_cpu_analysis_2ca6dae1b7.png" loading="lazy" class="introa_img_med" 
							alt="Apple M5 Pro &amp; M5 Max CPU Analysis - M5 Max is not much faster than the M4 Max" width="168" height="126" ></picture></div><div class="introa_rm_text"><h2 class="introa_title">Apple M5 Pro & M5 Max CPU Analysis - M5 Max is not much faster than the M4 Max</h2><div class="introa_rm_abstract" >Apple launched their new M5 Pro & M5 Max chips with different a different approach including tiles and new super cores. We test and analyze the new M5 Pro/Max CPUs, both in terms of performance as well as efficiency. Users of the new M5 Pro can be very happy, but the results of the new M5 Max is a bit sobering. <b>Update: MBP 16 with M5 Max</b></div><span class="introa_review_specs">Apple M5 Pro 18-Core, M5 Pro 20-Core GPU, 16.2", 2.1 kg</span><div class="itemauthordate"></div></div></article></a>

<a class="introa_medium" href="https://www.notebookcheck.net/Apple-MacBook-Pro-16-2026-Review-M5-Pro-makes-one-of-the-best-multimedia-laptops-even-better.1245523.0.html"><article>
<div class="introa_rm_img"><picture><source srcset="/fileadmin/_processed_/webp/Notebooks/Apple/MacBook_Pro_16_2026_M5_Pro/mbp_16_m5_pro_case_04-JPG-q82-w168-h.webp 1x, /fileadmin/_processed_/webp/Notebooks/Apple/MacBook_Pro_16_2026_M5_Pro/mbp_16_m5_pro_case_04-JPG-q82-w336-h.webp 2x, /fileadmin/_processed_/webp/Notebooks/Apple/MacBook_Pro_16_2026_M5_Pro/mbp_16_m5_pro_case_04-JPG-q82-w672-h.webp 4x" type="image/webp" media="(min-width:450px)"><source srcset="/fileadmin/_processed_/webp/Notebooks/Apple/MacBook_Pro_16_2026_M5_Pro/mbp_16_m5_pro_case_04-JPG-q82-w672-h.webp" media="(max-width:450px)"><img src="fileadmin/_processed_/a/3/csm_mbp_16_m5_pro_case_04_b8a4593cf7.jpg" loading="lazy" class="introa_img_med" 
							alt="Apple MacBook Pro 16 2026 Review - M5 Pro makes one of the best multimedia laptops even better" width="168" height="126" ></picture></div><div class="introa_rm_text"><h2 class="introa_title">Apple MacBook Pro 16 2026 Review - M5 Pro makes one of the best multimedia laptops even better</h2><div class="introa_rm_abstract" >The MacBook Pro 16 with the M5 Pro gets a big bump both in terms of CPU as well as GPU performance. Apple also includes faster PCIe 5.0 SSDs as well as Wi-Fi 7, so the overall package is even better than before. <b>Update: M5 Pro beats RTX 5090 in many creator benchmarks</b></div><span class="introa_review_specs">Apple M5 Pro 18-Core, M5 Pro 20-Core GPU, 16.2", 2.1 kg</span><div class="itemauthordate"></div></div></article></a>
<p><b>Apple MacBook Pro 16 2026 M5 Pro</b>: Apple M5 Pro 20-Core GPU, 16.20", 2.1 kg<br >
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="">External Review</span> &raquo; <a href="https://www.notebookcheck.net/Apple-MacBook-Pro-16-2026-M5-Pro.1256292.0.html">Apple MacBook Pro 16 2026 M5 Pro</a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=""></span> &raquo; <a href="https://www.notebookcheck.net/Apple-s-M5-Pro-M5-Max-easily-beat-the-RTX-5090-in-PugetBench-creator-benchmarks.1252582.0.html">Apple's M5 Pro & M5 Max easily beat the RTX 5090 in PugetBench creator benchmarks</a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=""></span> &raquo; <a href="https://www.notebookcheck.net/The-base-model-of-the-MacBook-Pro-16-with-the-M5-Pro-and-1-TB-SSD-is-an-excellent-multimedia-laptop.1248691.0.html">The base model of the MacBook Pro 16 with the M5 Pro and 1 TB SSD is an excellent multimedia laptop</a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=""></span> &raquo; <a href="https://www.notebookcheck.net/Major-weakness-Apple-MacBook-Neo-battery-life-suffers-from-excessive-cost-cutting.1246942.0.html">Major weakness: Apple MacBook Neo battery life suffers from excessive cost cutting</a></p></div>
